OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murdering men in
OL,4,Aalleged arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering two men in
OL,7,Fan alleged arson attack in east London.
OL,9,FMohammed Djellal and Fawzi Bouchabou
OL,10,Fdied in the fire on Forest Road,
OL,11,FWalthamstow, on 21 April 2024. The Old
OL,12,FBailey previously heard the
OL,13,Fmulti-occupancy block was "overwhelmed"
OL,14,Fwith flames and the men died from smoke
OL,15,Finhalation.
OL,17,FFouad Boudra, 25, an Algerian national,
OL,18,Fwas extradited from France over the
OL,19,Falleged murders.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
