OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murdering men in
OL,4,Aalleged arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded not guilty to two counts of
OL,7,Fmurder and two of manslaughter. He also
OL,8,Fdenies arson with intent to endanger
OL,9,Flife, reckless arson to a property and
OL,10,Ftwo counts of causing grievous bodily
OL,11,Fharm with or without intent to a third
OL,12,Fman.
